@startuml
title M6-AN-FIG-01 业务类模型整体结构（分析建议，待共同确认）
hide empty members
left to right direction
package "访问与认领" {
  class "账号" as Account
  class "认领申请" as Claim
  class "私有证明引用" as Evidence
  class "审核记录" as Review
  class "维护授权" as Grant
}
package "学术实体与门户" {
  class "学者" as Scholar
  class "学者门户" as Portal
  class "机构" as Institution
  class "成果" as Achievement
  class "成果参与关系（候选）" as Participation
  class "领域" as Field
}
package "来源与处理" {
  class "来源记录" as SourceRecord
  class "采集任务" as CollectionTask
  class "处理与更新记录" as ProcessRecord
}
Account "1" -- "0..*" Claim : 提交
Claim "0..*" --> "1" Portal : 申请目标
Claim "1" -- "1..*" Evidence : 创建时有效引用
Claim "1" -- "0..*" Review : 审核留痕
Account "1" -- "0..*" Grant : 被授权主体
Portal "1" -- "0..1" Grant : 当前有效维护授权
Portal "0..1" --> "1" Scholar : 展示
Scholar "1" -- "0..*" Participation : 参与主体
Achievement "1" -- "0..*" Participation : 参与成果
Scholar "0..*" -- "0..*" Institution : 有依据的机构关系
Achievement "0..*" -- "0..*" Field : 分类
SourceRecord "0..*" --> "0..1" Achievement : 当前规范映射
CollectionTask "1" -- "0..*" ProcessRecord : 执行处理
ProcessRecord ..> SourceRecord : 处理并追溯
ProcessRecord ..> Achievement : 形成或更新
note bottom of Claim
  创建申请不授予维护权；终态不可由失败请求回退。
  审核决定、授权、审计必须原子一致。
end note
note bottom of SourceRecord
  映射按单成果来源记录的当前关系表达。
  来源行数、关系数不等于唯一公开成果数。
end note
legend bottom
  本地概念语义稿，非CodeArts导出；非数据库设计或冻结公共实体。
  详细类、属性和时序由对应岗位细化。
endlegend
@enduml
